ing.\"\n\n### Step 4: Summarize the assignments\n- **Position 1**:\n  - Movie-Genre: adventure\n  - Job: police-officer\n  - Hobby: collecting\n\n- **Position 2**:\n  - Movie-Genre: thriller\n  - Job: journalist\n  - Hobby: filmmaking\n\n### Step 5: Answer the questions\n1. At what position is the person who watches adventure?\n   - Position 1.\n\n2. What hobby does the person who is a journalist do?\n   - Filmmaking.\n\n3. What is the job of the person who watches adventure?\n   - Police-officer.\n\n4. What is the job of the person who watches thriller?\n   - Journalist.\n\n### Final answers:\n<solution>1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.2399076521396637}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.02696080692112446}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -0.7194397449493408}, {"token": " down", "logprob": -0.18235160410404205}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.025340761989355087}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.1036037802696228}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.10814286023378372}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.06999058276414871}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.0018647201359272003}, {"token": ".\n\n", "logprob": -0.8003325462341309}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -0.08774098753929138}, {"token": " Step", "logprob": -2.358100414276123}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.00255769956856966}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.0014352031284943223}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.00015233787416946143}, {"token": " Define", "logprob": -2.548267364501953}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.25566381216049194}, {"token": " attributes", "logprob": -1.5394320487976074}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.13835155963897705}, {"token": " possible", "logprob": -2.468918800354004}, {"token": " values", "logprob": -0.04725818336009979}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.08062402158975601}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -1.696979284286499}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -0.98571813